<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 1in">(b)&nbsp;<U>Entire
Agreement</U>. This Agreement (including any Exhibits hereto) constitutes the sole and entire agreement of the parties to this Agreement
