<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0.5in">8.&nbsp;<U>No
Admission of Wrongdoing</U>. The parties agree that neither this Agreement nor the furnishing of the consideration set forth in the Employment
Agreement shall be deemed or construed at any time for any purpose as an admission by any party of any liability, wrongdoing or unlawful
